'''Gentlemen''' (ジェントルマン, ''Jentoruman'', '''Gentleman''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Worker Cat Max UP (Sm): Wallet size is increased by 10%.

